  "bio": "Aito Tattoo is a masterful tattoo artist specializing in the intricate and powerful style of tribal tattoos, particularly the Patutiki/Polynesian tradition. Nestled in the scenic locale of Pully, Switzerland, Aito's ability to create breathtaking tattoos freehand without stencils is a testament to their exceptional skill level. Clients are consistently amazed by the stunning, personalized artwork that Aito crafts with precision and artful detail.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Pully, Vaud, Switzerland\n\nTattoo artist since 2005\nGuest @utopink.ch Moudon",
